    {
      "title": "Повторный вызов — убирать нечего",
      "text": "Обслуживание — одна транзакция под строкой-замком: из нескольких процессов работает один, остальные получают `skipped: true`. Запускать его можно сколько угодно часто — повтор ничего не ломает.",
      "code": "const { queue: _queue, ...report } = JSON.parse((await cli(['maintain', '--dsn', ADMIN_DSN, '--schema', name])).out);\nreturn report;",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">queue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">_queue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">report</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cli</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'maintain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--dsn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ADMIN_DSN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--schema'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name])).out);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> report;</span></span></code></pre>",
